window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-7eb60a7a820b51e7"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"chatgpt-on-the-web\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"chatgpt\">网页版 ChatGPT</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"research-analyze-and-create-in-your-browser\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">在浏览器中研究、分析和创作</h2> <p>提出问题、研究主题，或描述一项包含多个步骤的任务。ChatGPT 可以使用你的文件和已连接的工具来创建文档、演示文稿、电子表格及其他成果。</p> <p><a id=\"start-here\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">从这里开始</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开 ChatGPT（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7?anchor=getting-started\">网页快速入门</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"why-use-chatgpt-on-the-web\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt_1\">为什么使用网页版 ChatGPT</h3> <ul> <li><strong>从明确的任务开始：</strong> 告诉 ChatGPT 你的目标，并提供它所需的上下文；之后再通过后续消息逐步完善结果。</li> <li><strong>使用你的文件和工具：</strong> 借助文件、项目和插件，为 ChatGPT 提供任务所需的信息和工具。</li> <li><strong>创建可分享的文件：</strong> 将研究与分析转化为文档、演示文稿、电子表格及其他完整成果。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"getting-started\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">开始使用</h2> <p><strong>开始使用网页版。</strong></p> <p>打开 ChatGPT，选择你的工作方式，并清楚说明期望的结果，同时提供任务所需的上下文。</p> <p><a id=\"1-open-chatgpt-and-sign-in\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"1-chatgpt\">1. 打开 ChatGPT 并登录</h3> <p>前往 <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">chatgpt.com（需联网）</a>，使用你的 ChatGPT 账户登录。</p> <p><a id=\"2-select-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"2-work\">2. 选择 Work</h3> <p>如果要进行研究、分析，或创建文档、电子表格、演示文稿、Sites 以及处理其他多步骤任务，请选择 <strong>Work</strong>。如果只是获取答案或进行对话，请选择 <strong>Chat</strong>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">了解如何使用 ChatGPT</a></p> <p><a id=\"3-start-a-chat-or-choose-a-project\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"3\">3. 开始聊天或选择项目</h3> <p>一次性任务可以使用聊天。若要随着工作推进，将相关聊天、文件和说明集中管理，请使用项目。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">了解聊天和项目</a></p> <p><a id=\"4-send-your-first-message\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"4\">4. 发送你的第一条消息</h3> <p>描述你想要的结果，并添加 ChatGPT 所需的所有文件或上下文。你可以通过后续消息继续完善结果。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-63f294417c75d859\">浏览示例用例（官方来源暂不可用）</a></p> <p><a id=\"next-steps\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_4\">后续步骤</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">了解如何使用 ChatGPT</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">选择模型和推理级别</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">添加技能和插件</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">创建并完善文件</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"see-what-you-can-do-on-the-web\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">看看你能在网页端做什么</h2> <p>使用 Chat 快速获取答案；对于多步骤任务，则可使用 Work，并结合你的文件、插件和推理设置来完成。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">选择 Chat 或 Work</a>：使用 Chat 探索问题或梳理想法。当你已有明确目标，并希望 ChatGPT 进行规划、收集上下文，直至把较大的任务推进到可供审查的结果时，请切换到 Work。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">选择合适的模型和推理级别</a>：在输入区中选择模型和推理级别。先从默认推理强度开始；当任务需要更深入的规划、分析或更大规模的多智能体运行时，再提高推理强度。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">引入工具和可重复使用的工作流</a>：安装插件，以连接 Google Drive、GitHub 或 Slack 等服务。当你希望 ChatGPT 遵循特定工作流、采用团队指南或以一致的方式产出成果时，可以添加技能。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">创建并完善最终文件</a>：使用 ChatGPT Work，根据你的源材料创建文档、演示文稿、电子表格或 PDF。在聊天中审查结果、提出有针对性的修改要求，并在文件准备好后下载成品。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"use-chatgpt-on-the-web-when\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt_2\">在这些情况下使用网页版 ChatGPT……</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7?anchor=getting-started\">你需要完成一项多步骤任务</a>：ChatGPT Work 可以规划任务、收集上下文，并让多个步骤持续朝着明确结果推进。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">任务需要更深入的推理</a>：对于复杂的规划和分析，可以选择能力更强的模型或提高推理强度。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">工作依赖你的工具和上下文</a>：使用插件和技能引入已连接的信息来源、执行操作，并遵循可重复使用的工作流。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">你需要一个可审查和分享的文件</a>：将源材料转化为文档、演示文稿、电子表格或 PDF，再根据反馈加以完善。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt-on-the-web\">ChatGPT on the web</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"research-analyze-and-create-in-your-browser\">Research, analyze, and create in your browser</h2> <p>Ask a question, research a topic, or describe a multi-step task. ChatGPT can use your files and connected tools to create documents, presentations, spreadsheets, and other outputs.</p> <h3 id=\"start-here\">Start here</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open ChatGPT (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7?anchor=getting-started\">Web quickstart</a></li> </ul> <h3 id=\"why-use-chatgpt-on-the-web\">Why use ChatGPT on the web</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Start with a clear task:</strong> Give ChatGPT a goal and the context it needs, then refine the result through follow-up messages.</li> <li><strong>Use your files and tools:</strong> Use files, projects, and plugins to give ChatGPT the information and tools the task requires.</li> <li><strong>Create files you can share:</strong> Turn research and analysis into documents, presentations, spreadsheets, and other finished work.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"getting-started\">Getting started</h2> <p><strong>Get started on the web.</strong></p> <p>Open ChatGPT, choose how you want to work, and give it a clear outcome plus the context it needs.</p> <h3 id=\"1-open-chatgpt-and-sign-in\">1. Open ChatGPT and sign in</h3> <p>Go to <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">chatgpt.com (online)</a> and sign in with your ChatGPT account.</p> <h3 id=\"2-select-work\">2. Select Work</h3> <p>Select <strong>Work</strong> for research, analysis, documents, spreadsheets, presentations, Sites, and other multi-step tasks. For an answer or conversation, select <strong>Chat</strong>.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">Learn how to use ChatGPT</a></p> <h3 id=\"3-start-a-chat-or-choose-a-project\">3. Start a chat or choose a project</h3> <p>Use a chat for a one-off task. Use a project to keep related chats, files, and instructions together as your work continues.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Learn about chats and projects</a></p> <h3 id=\"4-send-your-first-message\">4. Send your first message</h3> <p>Describe the result you want and add any files or context ChatGPT needs. You can refine the result with follow-up messages.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-63f294417c75d859\">Explore example use cases (official source unavailable)</a></p> <h3 id=\"next-steps\">Next steps</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">Learn how to use ChatGPT</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">Choose a model and reasoning level</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">Add skills and plugins</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Create and refine files</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"see-what-you-can-do-on-the-web\">See what you can do on the web</h2> <p>Use Chat for quick answers, or use Work with your files, plugins, and reasoning settings for multi-step tasks.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">Choose Chat or Work</a>: Use Chat to explore a question or shape an idea. Switch to Work when you have a clear outcome and want ChatGPT to plan, gather context, and carry a larger task through to a reviewable result.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">Choose the right model and reasoning</a>: Select a model and reasoning level from the composer. Start with the default effort, then increase it when a task needs deeper planning, analysis, or a larger multi-agent run.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">Bring in tools and repeatable workflows</a>: Install plugins to connect services such as Google Drive, GitHub, or Slack. Add skills when ChatGPT should follow a specific workflow, use team guidance, or produce work in a consistent way.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Create and refine finished files</a>: Use ChatGPT Work to create a document, presentation, spreadsheet, or PDF from your source material. Review the result in the chat, request focused revisions, and download the finished file when it is ready.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"use-chatgpt-on-the-web-when\">Use ChatGPT on the web when…</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7?anchor=getting-started\">You need to complete a multi-step task</a>: ChatGPT Work can plan the task, gather context, and keep multiple steps moving toward a clear result.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">The task needs deeper reasoning</a>: Choose a stronger model or increase reasoning effort for complex planning and analysis.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">The work depends on your tools and context</a>: Use plugins and skills to bring in connected sources, take action, and follow repeatable workflows.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">You need a file you can review and share</a>: Turn source material into a document, presentation, spreadsheet, or PDF, then refine it through feedback.</li> </ul>"};
